00:33:01.280 --> 00:33:06.040
Blaidd takes on a much more human form.
Blaidd was created
&nbsp;

00:33:06.040 --> 00:33:09.880
in a much more modern age
than the beasts of old,
&nbsp;

00:33:09.880 --> 00:33:14.880
so it seems the Two Fingers skipped
